  "helpPageFaq1Question": "Does scanning a card create the company automatically?",
  "helpPageFaq1Answer": "Yes. When the photo names a company that already exists it links to it; when it doesn't, BusinessCard4U files a new company right away so you're not interrupted mid-scan. You can always change the linked company afterwards from the card's edit screen.",
