  "helpPageFaq2Answer": "Saved Cards are entries you added yourself — from a photo or typed in by hand. Friends are other BusinessCard4U users you're connected with, so their card stays up to date on your side whenever they edit it.",
  "helpPageFaq3Question": "Can I fix a field the scanner got wrong?",
  "helpPageFaq3Answer": "Every scanned field is editable — a scan is a best guess, not a final answer. Open the card and correct anything before saving.",
